{"id":"25e32e4a30","title":"Lx intro","template":"<section class=\"section lx-intro\" aria-labelledby=\"bradford-intro-title\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"lx-intro__grid\">\n      <div class=\"lx-intro__head\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">{{s0}}</p>\n        <h2 class=\"grad-head\" id=\"bradford-intro-title\">{{s1}}</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"lx-intro__copy\">\n        <p class=\"lx-intro__lede\">{{s2}}</p><p class=\"lx-intro__text\">{{s3}}</p><div class=\"lx-intro__more\" data-lx-more><p class=\"lx-intro__note\" id=\"bradford-intro-note\">{{s4}}</p><button class=\"lx-intro__toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"bradford-intro-note\" hidden>{{s5}}</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    \n    <div class=\"lx-ways\">\n      \n      <article class=\"lx-way lx-way--remote\">\n        <figure class=\"media ratio-16-9 lx-way__photo\">\n    {{i6}}\n  </figure>\n        <div class=\"lx-way__body\">\n          <span class=\"lx-way__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3 14v-2a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v2\"/><path d=\"M21 16a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3v4Z\"/><path d=\"M3 16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H3v4Z\"/><path d=\"M19 18v.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5 2.5H13\"/></svg></span>\n          <h3>{{s7}}</h3>\n          <p>{{s8}}</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"lx-way lx-way--onsite\">\n        <figure class=\"media ratio-16-9 lx-way__photo\">\n    {{i9}}\n  </figure>\n        <div class=\"lx-way__body\">\n          <span class=\"lx-way__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"19\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"5\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M9 19h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-11a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H15\"/></svg></span>\n          <h3>{{s10}}</h3>\n          <p>{{s11}}</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>","uses":1,"slots":[{"k":"s0","type":"s","label":"Label above heading 1","default":"What it covers"},{"k":"s1","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"Support that keeps Bradford businesses running"},{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"We provide the ongoing maintenance and management of your users, hardware and infrastructure, from password resets to cyber security threat management, following the ITIL continual-improvement model."},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"Most issues are resolved remotely and fast. When something needs hands on hardware, our engineers travel to you, so Bradford businesses get quick fixes and minimal disruption."},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"Across 2025 our average first response time was 9 minutes and our average resolution time was 6 hours, measured across every ticket we handled. We are a team of five engineers supporting more than 30 businesses, from two-user teams to organisations of 150+ users. Most Bradford issues are resolved remotely by our UK service desk, and when something needs hands on hardware an engineer travels to you across Bradford and West Yorkshire. WhizzIT is Cyber Essentials certified and a Microsoft Cloud Solution Provider, so the security fundamentals are independently assessed rather than simply claimed."},{"k":"s5","type":"s","label":"Button 1","default":"Read more"},{"k":"i6","type":"i","label":"Image 1","default":{"html":"<picture>\n      <source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-480.avif 480w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-768.avif 768w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-1024.avif 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-1280.avif 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\">\n      <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-480.webp 480w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-768.webp 768w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-1024.webp 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\">\n      <img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-1280.webp\" alt=\"IT support engineer wearing a headset taking a customer call\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n    </picture>","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/it-support-engineer-headset-1280.webp"}},{"k":"s7","type":"s","label":"Heading 2","default":"Remote IT Support Bradford"},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"Secure remote access to resolve software errors, updates, security alerts and connectivity problems quickly, no waiting for a visit."},{"k":"i9","type":"i","label":"Image 2","default":{"html":"<picture>\n      <source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-480.avif 480w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-768.avif 768w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-1024.avif 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-1280.avif 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\">\n      <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-480.webp 480w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-768.webp 768w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-1024.webp 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw\">\n      <img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/whizzit-van-outside-office-1280.webp\" alt=\"Branded WhizzIT van parked outside the office\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async